# Written by `next dev` on every run (generate-agent-files.js). Generated
# content telling coding agents which Next version this is — useful locally,
# not something this repo should carry. Ignored rather than committed so the
# tree stays clean without the repo growing files nobody here wrote.
apps/web/AGENTS.md
apps/web/CLAUDE.md
